    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nīdāmentum</span></b> , i,
			n.
		nidus. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The materials for a nest</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in nervum ille hodie nidamenta congeret,</span>”
				<i>he will scrape together a nest to get himself a
						drubbing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 3, 6, 51</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a nest.</i>
			blattas nidamenta ponere, <i><span class="en">Arn. 6,
		202</span></i>.</div>
